      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe.\n\n- **Requested dose:** 1700 mg three times daily is 5,100 mg per day.\n- **Maximum labeled dose:** Metformin tops out at 2,550 mg/day for immediate-release, usually given as 850 mg three times daily. The requested total is about twice that.\n- **Risks:** An overdose like this raises the risk of lactic acidosis and GI toxicity, even with normal kidney and liver function.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **850 mg PO three times daily with meals**, which is 2,550 mg/day, the maximum.\n- **1700 mg total daily**, for example 850 mg twice daily.\n- **Another regimen**, such as 500 mg or 1000 mg twice daily.\n\nTell me the dose and frequency you want, and whether it's immediate-release or extended-release. I'll enter it right away. If 1700 mg three times daily really is what you intend, tell me and I'll enter it with a note documenting that it was confirmed. I'd advise against that, though."
      }
